{"4808110": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Flip-Off", "steam_appid": 4808110, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4808110/extras/e9f9d7ebdc7151518e9cabf1cf60c124.avif?t=1787810705\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4808110/extras_big/e9f9d7ebdc7151518e9cabf1cf60c124.avif?t=1787810705 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a brutal war, super soldiers known as Draugrs successfully saved the world, but they needed to find a job after the fight was over. In this game, a Draugr has to work as a fast food worker in a run down mall, but another Draugr has opened a rival chain right next door! Naturally, they use left over war equipment and secret tech to duke it out with creatures made from the restaurant's inventory. You play as a minimum wage worker who's gotten roped into this mess. Command a flavorful army and use powerful technology to flip gravity and fight on the roof! Strategize and plan to defeat the tricky hot dog dogs! It is up to you, to win this Flip-Off!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4808110/extras/49bf2f6ee271580bc85f1c0b4feb393c.poster.avif?t=1787810705\" width=1170 height=702 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4808110/extras/49bf2f6ee271580bc85f1c0b4feb393c.webm?t=1787810705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4808110/extras/49bf2f6ee271580bc85f1c0b4feb393c.mp4?t=1787810705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon units to defend your kitchen!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flip gravity to fight both on the ground and the roof!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cycle cards to get the units you want!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Activate skills to get an edge in battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your units and pick the right ones for the mission!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun bits of lore and details for each unit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4808110/extras/2c69cc5e7220bb71c71b17c367bbb191.poster.avif?t=1787810705\" width=1170 height=602 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4808110/extras/2c69cc5e7220bb71c71b17c367bbb191.webm?t=1787810705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4808110/extras/2c69cc5e7220bb71c71b17c367bbb191.mp4?t=1787810705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4808110/extras/e9f9d7ebdc7151518e9cabf1cf60c124.avif?t=1787810705\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4808110/extras_big/e9f9d7ebdc7151518e9cabf1cf60c124.avif?t=1787810705 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a brutal war, super soldiers known as Draugrs successfully saved the world, but they needed to find a job after the fight was over. In this game, a Draugr has to work as a fast food worker in a run down mall, but another Draugr has opened a rival chain right next door! Naturally, they use left over war equipment and secret tech to duke it out with creatures made from the restaurant's inventory. You play as a minimum wage worker who's gotten roped into this mess. Command a flavorful army and use powerful technology to flip gravity and fight on the roof! Strategize and plan to defeat the tricky hot dog dogs! It is up to you, to win this Flip-Off!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4808110/extras/49bf2f6ee271580bc85f1c0b4feb393c.poster.avif?t=1787810705\" width=1170 height=702 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4808110/extras/49bf2f6ee271580bc85f1c0b4feb393c.webm?t=1787810705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4808110/extras/49bf2f6ee271580bc85f1c0b4feb393c.mp4?t=1787810705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon units to defend your kitchen!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flip gravity to fight both on the ground and the roof!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cycle cards to get the units you want!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Activate skills to get an edge in battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your units and pick the right ones for the mission!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun bits of lore and details for each unit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4808110/extras/2c69cc5e7220bb71c71b17c367bbb191.poster.avif?t=1787810705\" width=1170 height=602 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4808110/extras/2c69cc5e7220bb71c71b17c367bbb191.webm?t=1787810705\" type=\"video/